WEBVTT

00:00:03.202 --> 00:00:05.813
Open Settings, Commerce, Customers.

00:00:05.813 --> 00:00:10.524
Erase inactive guests after sets how many months a guest who has not

00:00:10.524 --> 00:00:12.371
bought or paid is kept.

00:00:12.371 --> 00:00:16.255
After that, the store erases the guest's personal data.

00:00:16.255 --> 00:00:18.802
The default is twenty-four months.

00:00:19.256 --> 00:00:24.093
Anonymize guest orders after sets how long a paid or canceled guest order

00:00:24.093 --> 00:00:27.951
keeps the buyer's name, email, phone and billing address.

00:00:27.951 --> 00:00:33.033
After twelve months, by default, they are removed, but the country and region

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:34.993
stay for your tax records.

00:00:34.993 --> 00:00:37.075
Enter zero to keep the data.

00:00:37.075 --> 00:00:41.116
Customers with an account are kept while the account exists.

00:00:41.569 --> 00:00:47.929
On the same page, Billing address at checkout chooses whether buyers must give a billing address.

